<!-- MoodyFin user menu, opened by the header's picture (ActivateWindow(1152)). the Jellyfin theme's look/Inject/Header/
     ue-header-avatar.css: glass panel rgba(14,14,16,.94), 1 px white 8 % border, radius 16, padding 6; head = picture 44
     (2 px white 12 % ring) + name (Bebas 26, 28 here) + "Administrator" / "Signed in" (600 12 px at 50 %), line under it;
     items 10 / 12 padding, radius 10, Medium 14 (15 here) at 88 %, icons 20 at 60 %; focused = 7 % white, 3 px accent
     bar, accent icon; Sign Out #ff7a7a. Jellyfin's web-only items (dashboard, metadata, quick connect) become Kodi's:
       1161 Settings, 1162 MoodyFin (skin settings), 1163 Jellyfin (add-on settings), 1167 Dashboard (administrators;
       Custom_1153_MoodyFinDashboard.xml), 1164 Add-ons,
       1165 Power, 1166 Sign Out (back to the profile picker; only with profiles)
